Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（古巴 哈瓦那）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们换上的零件有福特 普利茅斯和凯迪拉克的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We swap in parts from Ford Plymouths and Cadillac.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祖父1957年买下了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather bought it in 1957.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死后就传给了我爸 然后传给我哥 现在到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he died it passed to my father, Then my brother and now to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 这是船上用的发动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this, this is an engine from a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能让它动起来就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes to keep it running.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是古巴精神所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a cuban spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的精神所在吧 可别弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your spirit, keep it up. Never ever lose that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表弟他 他有麻烦了 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your cousin. He's in trouble, come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样好吗 我知我有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do this, Understand my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走这车我靠什么吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't make living without my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪我 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't my problem bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托雷托 久仰大名啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto, I heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛扣我表弟的车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why he hooking up my cousin's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,早前他跟我借钱 之后还不上 那我就把车拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning, I gave it to him. He can't pay. I take the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再宽限我几天就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初可没约好要宽限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few more days isn't part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,得啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了约定 就要说到做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a deal you gotta live up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然有了约定！你做不到也得做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a deal! You gonna live up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到也得做到？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna live up to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你玩的也是套路啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are one of those types.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先搞到别人的车 再转运回美国对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take everyone's ride and then ship it back to the states.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对自己人放尊重点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should show your people some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话给我小心点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这下出大事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不谈人只谈车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep it about the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的被吓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要车？得光明正大地要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a car? Get it the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么着 - 飙一把试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Race war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,车已经是我的了 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already own it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 他的车可是岛上最快的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, his car is the fastest car in the Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他装了什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what he has under the hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他车里装什么并不重要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, it doesn't matter what's under a hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正重要的是谁来掌控方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that matters is who's behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 那还有假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think so? - I know so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就赌他的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then race his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不跑四分之一英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't racing a quarter mile here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,按古巴这里的长度来跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We race the cuban mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激你挺身而出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate you what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的车是岛上最慢的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car is the slowest car on the Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把座椅 车门 电源都拆掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the seats the doors the battery…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了发动机之外 剩下的都不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't the motor, take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一氧化亚氮吗？- 不 费南多 这是古巴版的氧化亚氮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Laughing gas? - Nah, Fed. This is cuban NOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是干什么 - 山寨版涡轮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Warm as turbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把真空管路拉起来接好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull that back in line…Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是老司机的老把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old trick used to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case of emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道发动机承受不了那么大劲儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's way too much booze for that engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是要快嘛 - 可能会爆缸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's going to be fast - It's gonna be a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑完全程就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only needs to go a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人 准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for this, family?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哈瓦那！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Havana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别落后 车手准备好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't be last. Racers ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 那车就该呆在垃圾堆里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That car belongs in the trash bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停一下 - 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要去哪 - 谁知道 追上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we going? - I don't know. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 偷袭他 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go steer - Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计 看看这个能不能行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, buster… Let's see if this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话就得算数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也同样嬴取了我的尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you earn my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你的尊重就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your respect is good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 大表弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo Cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 毁了你的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry 'bout your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正那车对我家人来说也是太慢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your's was too slow for a Torreto anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的英帕拉 你是当真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Impala. Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:48.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,《速度与激情8》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你笑的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢看你笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你招人开心呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是这地方让你开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this place makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就好像能和你说话一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it speaks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得那个小伙吗？曾经的车手和他父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that guy? The Racer and his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车上装船发动机那个 - 是啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one with the boat engine - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 当然记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时看着他们 我就… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking at them, and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就忍不住在想象 你要是当爹会是什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't help but too imagine what you'd be like, if you were dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我还没怀孕呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no… I'm not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要一个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是我想要的 而是你想不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about what I want or what you want…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我们没聊过这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about why we haven't asked the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可帮一手的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 需要帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 应该是需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车好像是燃料不足了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you're not getting any fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是电磁阀出问题了 我看看能不能帮你修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can get some power into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么想到来古巴的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you to Cuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其它人来这儿的原因一样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing that brings everyone else to Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,文化 人 美女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Culture People Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来到古巴呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you to Cuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 工作！- 星期五便服上班日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Work! - Must be casual Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜月过得还顺利吗 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that honeymoon going Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的燃油继电器不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fuel relay is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢玩游戏 而且从没输过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to play games. Beaten the bests alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我今天赶时间 你要是有话想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kinda in a rush, so if you got something to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的游戏可不太一样 我能向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this is a very different game that I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的可是比游戏高级多的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something much greater at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己的命运我自己创造 - 但今天不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I choose to make my own fate - Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你每天早上回公寓的路吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the road you take to your apartment every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出了什么异样了吗 多姆？圣地亚哥饭店关门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else is different, Dom? The Santiago's closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买古巴咖啡要多走两条街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have to cross two blocks to go get your cuban coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 最终是？黑咖啡 不加糖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it? Black, no sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 为了今天见到你 我可做了很多工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… I've put a lot of work into getting you here in today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在这了 你想要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that I'm here, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你为我工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,早说还能省点时间呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I could have saved you a lot of time then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我是不为任何人工作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I don't work for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回你躲不了 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't walk away from this Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不跟我谈 迟早也是要谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have this conversation one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看命运就是这么有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that's the funny thing about fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它狡猾得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能带给你美好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can bring you beautiful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能带给你接下来的这个时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it can also bring you moments like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你说会为我工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will hear that you want to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会背叛你的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna betray your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛弃你的原则 毁掉你的家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}abandon your code, shatter your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你的团队… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, your team…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将面对他们唯一无法抗衡的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is about to go up against the only thing they can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 多姆 这事我不会跟任何人说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and Dom, I wouldn't mention this to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北纬34.1381 西经118.3534 上午9时）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会想进一切办法来攻击我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are gonna be hitting us with everything they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们进攻的时候要全速前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we wanna engage with maximum speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻挡他们的进攻 然后直奔我们的目标而去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neutralize the shooters and then move on to our objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两件事我需要你们记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two things I want you to keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选你们进这个队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose you for this squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你们是这个星球上 最英勇的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you are the most fearsome warriors on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And number two,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了战场就要竭尽所能的把它们全部干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go out there, you do your job. And you take 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人 都要达到这两点期望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone… And I mean everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请你们到商场美甲及修脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manice and pedice at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,待你们凯旋归来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later on today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈出脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆开阵势 准备进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,心怀感激并赞颂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一方热土
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,心怀感激并赞颂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一方热土
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,心怀感激并赞颂这一方热土
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的家人 不成功便成仁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,用团结夺取胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必胜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想踢球了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 姑娘们加油 加油加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, let's go, girls. Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最后两分钟 - 你这亲友团阵容强大啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Final 2 minutes - Quite the cheering section.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 妈妈们都来给孩子鼓劲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah. That's moms they come out to sport the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过妈妈好像比孩子还多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except there seems to be more moms than kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且多了不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way more like moms and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这里球迷基数大 加油 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a big soccer job. Let's go girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的情报挺准的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your intel was spot on…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个在波斯湾失踪的电磁脉冲武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A democly 7 EMP weapon that went missing in the gulf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,被解放阵线组织的军火贩子弄到了柏林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arms dealer from the Liberation front have it in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 电磁脉冲设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit - This thing can wipe out…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以让一个大城市的整个电网瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire electrical grid in a major city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灯 没有电力 瞬间回到石器时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lights, no power, instant stone age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇伊 玛雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chloe, Maya…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让她就那么跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let her run by you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动起来 动起来 - 霍布斯探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, let's go - Hey, Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是高级别大规模杀伤性武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a class 4 WMD.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这事情的严重性吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what's at stake here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道！我完全了解这事的严重性 好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I know exactly what is at stake here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我的红龙队这次要是输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Pink Butterflies beat my Red Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就与冠军无缘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means we lose the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我这20位小姑娘会哭的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means I have 20 little girls who are crying…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这代表我得花时间在雪糕店上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which then means I have to spend a lot of time in ice cream shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再带她们看蛋蛋的演唱会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lot of time in Tay-Tay concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蛋蛋是谁？- 泰勒·斯威夫特啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tay-Tay? - Yep? Taylor Swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要急死我啊 给我省省心好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be shitting me get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我们必须办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟人命关天啊 但我话先说清楚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of lives are at stake. I need to be clear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国政府不会以任何形式批准这次行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}US Government can not sanction this operation in anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得靠自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出了什么岔子 你就不只是被炒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing goes sideways you don't just get burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要坐牢去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们就没法把你弄出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's nothing we can do to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先听我说好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说唯一比拯救苍生更重要的… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that I love more than saving lives…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好别再跟我提政府的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't shut up with this government bullshit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出一点团队精神和尊重 送给我的红龙队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start showing some team spirit and respect for the Red Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就让20个姑娘排成队 挨个儿踢你的小蛋蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have all 20 of them lined up kick you right in the Tay-Tay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.23,0:19:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 红龙队！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 红龙队！- 对喽 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, Dragons! - Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,红龙队 加油 红龙队 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go Dragons… Go Dragons…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 他有空挡 快 是了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, he's open… Go, Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,进球的那个就是我女儿！太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my daughter right there! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀 真棒 快过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真棒 - 干得好 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awesome - Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 又要去公干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's gotta go to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 爸爸又要去工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah, daddy's gotta go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你需要个可以信赖的团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you gonna need to get a team that you can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我已经有团队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I already got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘻 多姆 - 嘻 霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Dom - Hey, Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个柏林的活 需要兄弟你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a job in Berlin, and I need a favor, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着队伍跟你在柏林会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grab the team and meet you in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 稍后见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks man. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.47,0:20:40.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.61,0:20:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你只需要引开他们就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were only to supposed to create a diversion, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚不是引开了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底用了多大量的炸药啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of the damn explosives did you use?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 特尔佳 可能全用了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know, Tez. All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 全用了？- 罗曼 老天爷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, all of it? - Roman, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 前面还有一大波粉丝等着你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christ! - You have more of your fan club ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还追着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是跟我们杠上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are taking this personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 我们刚炸了他们基地 还拿了电磁脉冲武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, we just blown up their facility and stole their EMP.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这性质就像体检时肛肠检查大夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than your doctor's cold fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿手指捅你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it's about as personal as it can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进第二阶段 - 还有第二阶段？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Phase 2 - Phase 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还瞒到现在才说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just gonna keep that to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.73,0:21:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那啥是第一阶段？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happen to Phase 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,都干什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that part?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你还记得那飞机吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, remember the airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你之外 所有人都把车开出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone drove their cars out but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 是我引擎罢工了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you my engine seized up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你那颗小胆罢工了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your balls that seized up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我做就行 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你不管该做什么 别瞎琢磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Roman, whatever you do. Don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 可以放了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,重磅炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bomb's away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,队形分散！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是大铁球 特尔佳 - 跟你们说一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great plan Tez - Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有漏网的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss some.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,先耐心等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真… 该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 特尔佳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you, Tez!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务结束后见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 队友们都干得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Great job, team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,先就地解散 去安全的地方等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's break up and meet me at the safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.01,0:23:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a job, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等回到基地 请你喝啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we can get back to the base. Beers on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.59,0:23:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是疯了吗 托雷托！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your god damn mind, Toretto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,托雷托 你碰那东西是要与我… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toretto you put hands on that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,及世界为敌啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have the whole world coming for you including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你想干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.73,0:23:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你最好想清楚 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you better think about this, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.59,0:23:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放手还不算晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't too late to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋背叛了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That some bitch just crossed us…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.05,0:24:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在说什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.59,0:24:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多姆拿走了电磁脉冲武器 - 胡说八道什么啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dom took the EMP - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.23,0:24:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来不及了 你们赶紧跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late for me. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.81,0:24:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才那种眼神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw that look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.50,0:24:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也曾见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that look before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆尼克·托雷托刚刚叛变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto just went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.24,0:25:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我拿到了他的通话记录 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, I got his phone records, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多来电无法查到号码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whole bunch of calls to untraceable numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次性手机打来 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burner phone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是装了扰码器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. Scrambled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,号码不变 但通过某种微型路由掩盖了信号踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same number but they got some sort of micro-router…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着和多姆联系的人… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to bury the signal path which means Dom is clearly…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.47,0:25:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,远在我们的层次之上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…communicating with somebody that is above our pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.71,0:25:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 虽然我不如你们了解多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I do not know Dom as well as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们还是面对现实吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if we just look at the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.17,0:25:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆一直在和神秘人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom's been having highly encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.51,0:25:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持加密联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}conversation with some mysterious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:25:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对霍布斯下手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took out Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.94,0:26:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷走了武器 现在还失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole the EMP, now he's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.73,0:26:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的意思是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what're you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许应该承认… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should consider the fact that…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.13,0:26:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobb's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.58,0:26:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆是真叛变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom did go rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莱蒂 - 当你要评判某人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Letty - Before you judge the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记得那个人曾救过你的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember you're breathing now because he saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就任凭她这么踩你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna let her bump your shoulder like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说… 她那口气太冲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying it out…That was a little aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛 给她写邮件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you gonna do. Email her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chick…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.56,0:26:43.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦顶级监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.24,0:26:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 且慢 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, wait, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.70,0:26:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 这身新装扮可真带劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is an exciting new look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.31,0:26:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可裤子裆部总是有那么 有点紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little tight on the crotch as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪个偶像天团拉来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What boyband bus did she fallen off?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的新助手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new junior associate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起负责这个案子 听你差遣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's working with me on this. All yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Nobody and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.53,0:27:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有权限把你弄出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been given the authority to get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要接受我们的条件就能自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is agree to the terms and you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.92,0:27:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这实习生说的条件是什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restraining wills, talking about, what terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.41,0:27:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认你在柏林的罪行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confess to your crimes in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛国 从事国际间谍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treason, international espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.40,0:27:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大规模损坏公民财产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Massive destruction of civic property.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.49,0:27:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照做 我们就能结案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, we close the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后上国防安全黑名单 正好合德国心意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the DSS blacklist. Sure Germany loves that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会正式成为罪犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially you'll be a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…噢…噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woah, woah, woah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.95,0:27:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这表达能力得练练啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to work on your delivery alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是非正式的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unofficially.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.70,0:27:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我一起干 是不记录在案的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off the books. Come work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.86,0:27:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不是罪犯 - 卢克 没事 就是个名号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a criminal - Luke Come on. Labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.85,0:27:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会认什么罪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接受私下交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no back room deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.65,0:27:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己惹得事我自己会解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got myself into this, I'm gonna get myself out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.98,0:27:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.73,0:27:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 早跟他这么说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do and that's what I told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这下满意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你庭审好运了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck in the course, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.37,0:27:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过你女儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算不为国家做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you're not gonna do it your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.57,0:28:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也考虑下孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least do it for your kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.42,0:28:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说错话了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big mistake kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 卢克 卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.63,0:28:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是用课本上那一套呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still working from the manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 他连规矩都还没搞清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he doesn't even really know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 饶了他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh come on. Give him a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.61,0:28:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.08,0:28:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.54,0:28:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真高兴 无名氏 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to see you, Nobody - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先记住第一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule No.1,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.65,0:28:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,知己才能知彼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}know your audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过你机会 你却搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you your shot, you shit the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.31,0:28:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我来示范正确的做法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna show you how to get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.32,0:28:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你死定了 警察！- 你死定了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're dead cop! - Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好哇 好哇 好哇… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.18,0:28:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克·霍布斯也蹲监狱了 都来瞧瞧啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke Hobbs behind bars. Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,执法犯法 你也有今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The band cop got it's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说这颜色挺配你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that color looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 沾上点你的血就更配了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Look a whole hell of a lot better with your blood on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.06,0:29:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 我的大力神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Good luck with that, Hercules.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.63,0:29:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察干了坏事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… gone bad. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.96,0:29:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是没新意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a cliche.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.20,0:29:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 欢迎你入伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah well. Welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别误解了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't get that twisted son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.41,0:29:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是一伙 也没什么共同点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't in no club. We got nothing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.64,0:29:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像你 我又不是来久住的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unlike you, I ain't gonna be here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.71,0:29:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,越狱你带铁锹了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring the shovel did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的钢筋混凝土有38英尺厚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause it's 38 feet of steel and concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他们是这么说的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up big dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要挖现在就动手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get to dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.47,0:29:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.33,0:30:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.43,0:30:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我再说一遍 那可就是对尸体说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I say it again, It will be to acorpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.38,0:30:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是想体验一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.89,0:30:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎归来 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.87,0:30:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边活儿干得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.67,0:30:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很兴奋吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excited about tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你出马吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.65,0:30:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with me Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.96,0:30:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要给我看你的鞋柜子？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Showing me your shoe collection? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.16,0:30:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同场合都有款合适的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pair for every occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的枪够装备一支小军队的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough guns here to outfit a small army. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:31:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些还只是冰山一角呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this is just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.74,0:31:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢你哪儿吗 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like about you, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.37,0:31:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个真正的亡命徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a genuine outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.73,0:31:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是按自己的规矩出牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're a man who lives by his own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.54,0:31:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但让我惊讶的是 之前我们在古巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which was surprising because when I saw you in Cuba, I heard about a.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.17,0:31:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说某人差点用摩托车把你给弄死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}guy who almost killed you with a motorcycle and.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.10,0:31:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却没有拿走他的车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you… let him keep his car?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.55,0:31:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 你是不是挺纳闷的？- 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, that confused you? - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我可以拿走他的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I could've taken his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.99,0:31:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不拿 意义更大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's about something bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.29,0:31:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能改变他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有那个义务啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我人就这样 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's who I am - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.79,0:31:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我问你个问题 多姆 你一生什么是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something Dom, what's the best thing in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是家人 - 不 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Family - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你真实想法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're being honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最在意的是每次飚车的那十秒种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the 10 seconds between.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.17,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那十秒里你什么都不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}start and finish, when you're not thinking about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.30,0:31:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你的家人 更没有责任 只有你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No family, not obligations, just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being free.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.59,0:32:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你 你最近忙着拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you. This whole saving the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.47,0:32:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟罗宾汉一样是没有意义的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin Hood nonsense you've been doing recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.35,0:32:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都是胡扯 那不是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bullshit. It's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,做回真实的自己吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.68,0:32:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你可以快活一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why live only a quarter mile at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.88,0:32:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用依赖飚车那短暂一瞬间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you can live your whole life that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.22,0:32:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那一身肌肉就这点本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See all those blow that muscles will give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,花拳绣腿有什么用处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All show and no…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.21,0:32:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这用处多着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I got plenty of goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.77,0:32:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是记忆错位了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have misplaced that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.27,0:33:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时是我把你打得屁滚尿流 从楼上扔下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I kicked your ass up in down that office of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.91,0:33:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.45,0:33:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡编乱造不也是你们英国人特色吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you Brits, rewriting History, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.33,0:33:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我只记得被扔出… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know. It was not me who was thrown out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.22,0:33:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,四楼窗户的人不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a 4 storey window.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.56,0:33:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己跳的 是我从四楼窗户跳下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumped. I jumped out of a 4 storey window.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.58,0:33:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我搭档的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving my partner's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.29,0:33:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because where I'm from,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.50,0:33:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打架从来不会用上扔炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't settle fight by throwing bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.65,0:33:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 真搞笑 这就是我的国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's funny, because where I'm from,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.50,0:33:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不需要女人来救男人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't need women to run to our rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.09,0:33:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 你相信跟前的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you really believe you could stand in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭赤手空拳就能击败我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beat me in a straight up old fashioned fist fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.49,0:33:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你给我听着 你和我… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something. Me and you…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.47,0:33:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对一单挑 谁都不许找帮手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One on one, no one else around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.20,0:33:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小屁股等着开花吧 揍你我就跟打手鼓一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will beat your ass like a Cherokee drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准哪天我们可以试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one day we will find that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.79,0:33:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你就祈祷那一天永不到来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you better hope that day never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.38,0:33:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过不行 无名氏先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no, Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.41,0:34:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开这牢房的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.74,0:34:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用自己方法出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get out my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.25,0:34:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是正道的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.92,0:34:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回牢房去 - 门只是出点故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back to your cell - It's just a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.53,0:34:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快退下！- 只是故障而已啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back! - Just a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.23,0:34:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.82,0:35:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等这一天已经很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就接着等 贱人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep waiting bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,用橡皮弹是个大错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubber bullets, big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.31,0:36:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀 比我预想的时间要久一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, took longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有两个问题 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 2 questions - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.11,0:36:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我女儿呢？- 在你妹那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My daughter? - With your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.99,0:36:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托雷托呢？- 你问这个有点意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Toretto? - That's interesting you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.39,0:36:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的新基地 欢迎来到无名之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my new base, welcome to Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.78,0:36:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这创意太贫乏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice little stair for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:36:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我待会有事要跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, It's something I don't wanna talk to you about…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:37:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着各位 感谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen guys. Thanks…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.71,0:37:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说怎么上铐子了 搞什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, what handcuff. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.82,0:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是滥用权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called the abuse of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说把他们关一起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to round 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.18,0:37:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又没让你铐住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that… hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.77,0:37:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们解开 老天爷 我真太尴尬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut 'em loose. Oh man, this is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.90,0:37:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起各位 我真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry guys, what do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.97,0:37:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么对待老朋友？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you treat old friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.60,0:37:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道这家伙真实身份呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even really know who the hell this guys is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁不重要 特尔佳 我就是个无名氏啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not matter who I am, Tez I'm like Nobody ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.50,0:37:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏 那他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody, then who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都不是 还不如我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nothing he's like less than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.44,0:37:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是和无名氏待在无名之地啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly we're getting nowhere, with nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.01,0:37:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这待了四个小时 饿的前胸贴后背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in here for 4 hours, my ribs are sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.63,0:37:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么想 反正我要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about y'all, but I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.82,0:37:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 建议你最好别走 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't recommend that - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.86,0:37:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们刚砸了柏林那一票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks to your bust Berlin job.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.81,0:37:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入国际刑警组织通缉犯前十名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all made interpol's top 10 most wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.85,0:37:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,前十名 还真不赖啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top 10? Uh-huh. That's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不包括你 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.86,0:37:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.43,0:37:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就差一点 你第十一名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just missed the cut, you're number 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 - 就我没排进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So - I missed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.59,0:37:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.79,0:37:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们都排第几啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What number did they come in at?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.99,0:37:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他六 他八 他九… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six, eight, nine…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:37:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是第十？不可能 她怎么可能第十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's Ten? That's impossible, there is no way she's at 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.25,0:38:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 她绝对可以第十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, She's definitely at 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.80,0:38:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来关注一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we focus on someone who.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.06,0:38:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会出现在任何名单上的人吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not gonna find out in anybody's list?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.98,0:38:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终确认还要等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are awaiting hard confirmation, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信她是那个网络恐怖分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that's the cyber terrorist known as Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.74,0:38:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等下 塞弗是一个组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no, Cipher's an organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.22,0:38:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的线报可不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to our sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.61,0:38:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她想干什么？- 不知道啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does she want? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.19,0:38:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗在黑客界地位就像上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher is like a digital active God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.58,0:38:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个组织 不 这个人 能从暗处操纵全世界的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, she, can manipulate world systems under shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.71,0:38:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能被黑的地方都任凭其摆布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that can be hacked…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.22,0:38:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且蹊跷的是… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here is the kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.59,0:38:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远找不到她的操作痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never find her linked to any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.71,0:38:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在网络世界每过几秒钟就清一次痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her digital identity is scrubbed every few seconds worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.35,0:38:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她就是那个终极大反派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So basically, she is the boogeyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.86,0:38:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.82,0:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜她是我见过的最性感的大反派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the hottest boogeyman I have ever seen, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.71,0:38:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁认识她 告诉她快来找哥哥我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If y'all know her, tell her to get extra boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你十二岁吗？- 你踢到我小腿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you, 12? - That was my scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.10,0:38:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们害怕匿名的黑客组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are scared of the hacker group Anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.73,0:38:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但匿名组织也不敢惹她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even anonymous won't mess with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这些到底由和我们有什么关系啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does any of this have to do with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.83,0:39:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没多少关系 莱蒂 但… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably nothing, Letty. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.45,0:39:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一件有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do find it interesting, apparently for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.32,0:39:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她不知为何正在和这个家伙合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's now working with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.82,0:39:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把一个随时能用的电磁脉冲武器交到她手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already delivered a fully operational EMP into her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用这种武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.10,0:39:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以让整座城市陷入战争火海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can turn any city in the world into a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.12,0:39:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你建议我们怎么做呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then what is it that you're suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.63,0:39:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不先找到多姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we find Dom huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.02,0:39:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们抓住他 然后弄明白… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first let's catch him and then figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.26,0:39:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么叛变 - 所以你要我们来… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- why he's turned - So y'all want us…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.21,0:39:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To track Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.34,0:39:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 我知道这个活儿不简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know Roman, it's kinda a big job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.10,0:39:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这压根就不可行 - 没错 所以我呢… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's impossible - Which is why…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.72,0:39:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们又找了一个帮手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing in an extra pair of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.82,0:39:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一天过得可真超值啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. My day just got a whole hell of a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.65,0:39:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生 你能告诉我 为什么请来这位… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody you want to tell me why you just put me in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.84,0:40:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱喝下午茶的下三滥到我眼前晃悠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this teen crumpeting criminal, some bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小脑萎缩的大嘴巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a big mouth on a small head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你的犯人编号是6753{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming from prisoner 6753.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我们忘了你干的好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think we've forgotten everything that you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.02,0:40:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不会和这个家伙一伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not… teaming up with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.72,0:40:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把话说清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get one thing clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.75,0:40:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不加入你的团队 我才不在乎你… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't on your team. I don't care about you, you crew…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.74,0:40:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们团队成员或是所谓的大家庭 我冲塞弗来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little family. I'm here for Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋要干嘛 来应聘吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna do apply for a job, Head-asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.51,0:40:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这件紧身T恤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that tight t-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.88,0:40:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像阻碍你大脑供血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is cutting off the circulation to your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.54,0:40:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该买大一号的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get bigger size.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.41,0:40:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是塞弗先找上我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher came to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.64,0:40:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我帮她偷龙葵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted me to steal Nightshade for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.06,0:40:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝后她就盯上我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I said no, she went off to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.74,0:40:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.73,0:40:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文兄弟 怎么能忘了他呢啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother Owen who could forget him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.49,0:40:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前到处惹是生非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former hell-raiser and current guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.97,0:40:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前在一个秘密的监牢里服刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a nasty little black site prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗毁了他 留下他等死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher corrupted him left him for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.06,0:40:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果有机会干掉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I get a shot to take her down,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.53,0:40:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我一定会抓住她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}believe me, flicks I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.99,0:40:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓我的鞋堵你屁股吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking my boot right up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.35,0:40:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位两位 找塞弗最快的途径就会通过托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, guys. The fastest way to find Cipher is through Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.54,0:40:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在除了我 这世上只有两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now aside from myself, there's only two men in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.03,0:40:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾成功追踪到他的下落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have ever managed to actually track him down with any success.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.23,0:40:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且怎么着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.51,0:40:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这俩人现在都站在我面前 随你们乐不乐意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're both standing in front of me right now. So like it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.56,0:41:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩要一起合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are gonna work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.47,0:41:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都明白了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.58,0:41:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就当是同意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.00,0:41:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我一个人明白了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.14,0:41:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这下子好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this oughtta be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.90,0:41:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 用天眼系统 我们冒着生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use God's eye. We put our lives on the line…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.24,0:41:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,满世界地去找人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running around the world trying to figure this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.14,0:41:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而天眼能找到任何人 对吧 用它找多姆不就得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can find anybody, right? Let's use it to find Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.72,0:41:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 这真是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, that is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.83,0:41:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that? Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.70,0:41:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂喂喂 假装没听见 - 无名氏先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And no, no! No pointing out - Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fire it up… huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.74,0:41:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 他在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him. He's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.67,0:41:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 第二处定位到香港了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, we have got a 2nd match in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.12,0:42:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 还有个在首尔 - 还有东京{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bejing and Seole - And Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.72,0:42:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索结果差不多覆盖全球各大城市了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just about every other major city on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.89,0:42:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们呢 首先会想到的是使用天眼系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so… God's eye was where we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.81,0:42:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但塞弗已经巧妙掩盖他们实际位置所在… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher's already created an evasion that masked her location by…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.72,0:42:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,向全球的随机地点发信息包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinging random spots all over the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.94,0:42:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你的想法不错啦 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was a good thought Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.86,0:42:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这让我的软件成了摆设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's made my programme obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.73,0:42:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that Ramsey…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.05,0:42:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们请你来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is why are you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.86,0:42:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走快捷方式在这里行不通的 小滑头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, simple solutions aren't gonna cut it here slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.37,0:42:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话干嘛看着我啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking at me when you're saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.37,0:42:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等下 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.57,0:42:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿没准真有快捷方式可走呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple solutions might just cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们为了让天眼发出虚拟信息包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order for God's eyes to give up all this false pings,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.90,0:42:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了通量逻辑组件数组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means they have to be using a free relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.18,0:42:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他俩怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.03,0:42:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说肯定有一个同步随机数发生器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means it has a decaying sync quantanizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.13,0:42:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以反过来利用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we can reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.71,0:42:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到信号源头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And track it back to the originating source.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.72,0:42:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,并找到多姆的真实位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find Dom's true location.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.05,0:42:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 他们有真本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling you, they got skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.72,0:42:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才就这么说的 记得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I was saying, remember in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.95,0:42:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们试试吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.73,0:43:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.71,0:43:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻翻你的教科书 组织力量响应吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time you wanna take your manual and start organizing first response…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.73,0:43:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻联系这地区部署的国际警力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a hold of our international…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.19,0:43:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然是新手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still green.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.69,0:43:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 闻到婴儿尿片味儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, like first baby shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.66,0:43:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦追踪到位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we've tried those location…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.03,0:43:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wanna mobilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.74,0:43:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即联系一个更好的混蛋 没人尊重你 就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a hold of a, better asshole. No one respects you, over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.73,0:43:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.61,0:43:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 他们不在中国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright they are not in China…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.64,0:43:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不在俄罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.98,0:43:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲排除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Europe's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.65,0:43:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一处还不能排除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this one's not going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.18,0:43:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有意思了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.05,0:43:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.25,0:43:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.13,0:44:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你们都喜欢吗 这是新一代脑震荡手榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you all enjoy that? Next generation concussion grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.27,0:44:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扰乱你们的感官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scrambles your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 一小时后会失效的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, It'll wear off in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.02,0:44:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.05,0:44:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 戴克 很高兴又见面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Deckard. Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.09,0:44:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看啊 多姆你人刚没走一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this, bodies not even cold Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.15,0:44:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人就找人来替代你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family's already replacing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选了个必输的团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose the loosing team.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.16,0:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说你弟弟比你精多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess your brother is smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.42,0:45:00.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欧文·肖）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.88,0:45:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,往主框架嵌入天眼真是聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart move embedding God's eye into the mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我大老远跑一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irritating to make me have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.46,0:45:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来把它收拾了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way down here to get it, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.52,0:45:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.53,0:46:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要背叛你的家人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna turn your back on family?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.34,0:46:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.53,0:46:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.61,0:47:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.22,0:47:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.09,0:47:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女的不知怎么着他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what she's got on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.12,0:47:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不是多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that wasn't Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.16,0:47:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩知道该怎么做 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bryan would know what to do - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.03,0:47:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把布莱恩和米娅再扯进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't bring Bryan and Mia into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.00,0:47:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不都说好了嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.97,0:47:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.85,0:47:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那一下 是做给她看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there was that for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.81,0:47:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看 还是给你做自己？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me, or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.49,0:47:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有那个必要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or was it either necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.86,0:48:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有必要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.93,0:48:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么东西是必要的 一切不过是选择而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is necessary. Everything is a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.91,0:48:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做个选择 你也一样啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply made one but so did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以拦我 但你选择不拦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have stopped me, but you chose not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.79,0:48:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇莱蒂会怎么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what Letty thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.12,0:48:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你踩住老虎的的脖子… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem of putting your foot on a Tiger's neck…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.07,0:48:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦在于你永远都不能抬脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is you can never let it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.93,0:48:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择来这的原因 我要提醒你一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I need to remind you why you chose to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.62,0:48:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.59,0:49:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.10,0:49:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.04,0:49:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不应该来这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoudn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.18,0:49:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能阻止我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's gonna get me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.28,0:49:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们三个都在她手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she has the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.59,0:49:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.70,0:49:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.65,0:49:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.70,0:49:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道自己怀孕的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.24,0:49:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚好发现莱蒂还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had just find out Letty was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定等莱蒂和你度蜜月回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I decided when Letty and you go back from your honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.28,0:50:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再告诉你孩子的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.76,0:50:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我还没有机会 就被她抓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she took us before I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.77,0:50:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他起名字了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.77,0:50:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我起的叫马科斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call him Michaels.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.18,0:50:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是他的中间名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That his middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大名应该由他爸爸来取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought his father should give him first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.90,0:50:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没什么好抱歉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing to be sorry for.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.23,0:50:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.12,0:50:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要保住我们的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just save our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.10,0:50:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.63,0:51:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,探视可好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.67,0:51:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知 我知道你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.78,0:51:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把警卫都支开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just let the guards go,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.73,0:51:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你在这房间只有两个对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there is only two opponents in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.29,0:51:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兹他有枪 所以你会想到先干掉他 我了解你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodes has the gun, so you'll take him out first, I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.72,0:51:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你会想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.79,0:51:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜是个警察 没准你们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena is a cop, maybe the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.37,0:51:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,能一起从这儿冲出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can fight your way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.57,0:51:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想的事太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.15,0:51:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还是帮你一把吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make it easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.73,0:51:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么来就怎么来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do with it as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.64,0:52:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听过选择理论吗 多姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of choice theory Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.38,0:52:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这理论有很多公式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bunch of axiems.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.83,0:52:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有两点需要你结合自身考虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only two you really need to concern yourself with,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.48,0:52:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其一 我们只能控制自己的行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One. The only person's behavior we can control is our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,其二 我们唯一能给对方的东西是信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two, the only thing we can truly give another person is information,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.46,0:52:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我给你一些信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let me give you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.74,0:52:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这里的摄像头了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this cameras in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.01,0:52:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你敢轻举妄动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment you make a move,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.47,0:52:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻会有携带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}highly paid men with weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.49,0:52:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器的人冲进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will make there way into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行一条具体指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With one very… specific instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.66,0:52:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是要救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.16,0:52:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要杀了你儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's to kill your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.50,0:52:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候可是枪林弹雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a lot of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.63,0:52:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一颗子弹就能让你失去一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it only takes one for you to loose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.48,0:52:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以丑话说在前头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have to ask you, because…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.71,0:52:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道家庭对你多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know family is so important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.49,0:53:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想做出那个选择吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really a choice you wanna make?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.56,0:53:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是的话 我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm ready as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.54,0:53:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天知道我多么想扣下这扳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pull this trigger, and God knows I wanna…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.54,0:53:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就算杀光飞机上所有人… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill everyone on this plane…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.98,0:53:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是救不出她俩母子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still couldn't get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.22,0:53:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你这儿是双人自动防故障系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you here manipulate this system.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.06,0:53:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我一个人打不开的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I'm alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.53,0:53:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没得选择！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.52,0:53:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想未必{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.57,0:54:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看看以前的多姆吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see the old Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.17,0:54:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.69,0:54:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.50,0:54:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个好梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.36,0:54:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.02,0:54:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她全删掉了 还拿走天眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wiped it off. Took God's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.68,0:54:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一能找到他们的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the one thing we could use to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.74,0:54:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一无所有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.56,0:54:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了 公主？- 快找到托雷托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, princess? - Find it to rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.08,0:54:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还能抽出几分钟时间来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've got couple of minutes to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.81,0:54:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要 我可以再次把你送进医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want me to send you to the hospital again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.94,0:55:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小子！- 首先啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo Rules! - First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.98,0:55:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是我名字 - 那就小无名氏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not my name - Little nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.99,0:55:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么叫我 - 就叫这个名字吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't call me that - Oh that's definitely stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.93,0:55:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我告诉那边那位殿下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great do me a favor, and tell your majesty over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.34,0:55:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到托雷托 会作为一个团队 找到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're gonna find Toretto. We find Toretto together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.42,0:55:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.84,0:55:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意给他来一顿抽耳刮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have me to slap that whickest biscuit right off his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.13,0:55:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下各位 我想戴克可能摸到门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, guys. I think Decker's actually onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.35,0:55:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想多姆和塞弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think Dom and Cipher got.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.81,0:55:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎么骗过我们入境的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the country without us knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.73,0:55:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐幽灵航班 - 我以为无法追踪的飞机… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ghost flights - That untraceable aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.77,0:55:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个互联网骗局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was all internet conspiracy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.87,0:55:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.90,0:55:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星和雷达网络覆盖地球各个角落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellites and radar grids…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.47,0:55:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All across the globe shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.87,0:55:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像洋流一样 他们的频道有的开有的关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an ocean. And they've got channels that open and close.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.43,0:55:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And theoretically,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.53,0:55:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要找到熟悉规律的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know the right people who Know the right patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.59,0:55:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能在盲区里飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fly right through the blind's box…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.88,0:55:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,且能够躲过探测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't be intercepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.17,0:55:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你知道多姆要去哪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know where Dom is headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.95,0:55:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.95,0:55:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗 卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see there Luke…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.00,0:55:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会相处得很好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys… are gonna get along just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.27,0:55:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也验证了 这第二条规则 你永远不会失去一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which proves, rule number two, you never lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.09,0:55:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire up the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.09,0:56:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 祝纽约之行玩的尽兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, have a bowl and a Big Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.03,0:56:10.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.90,0:56:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能说说我们为什么要这样出行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we travelling like this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.96,0:56:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们没有天眼 必须躲开监控网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Dom took God's Eye, so we need to stay off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.93,0:56:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可至于这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.66,0:56:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我呕吐之前问你个问题 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look here man. Before I throw up in my mouth…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.01,0:56:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底来这干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you what are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.28,0:56:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来回答你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.87,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我们的新行动基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to our new base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑啊 这是个什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now seriously, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.83,0:56:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可是天堂啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… is heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.22,0:57:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是局下属车库 绰号叫玩具店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agency garage. We call it the toy shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.71,0:57:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从东海岸毒枭那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we house every vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.54,0:57:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,缴获的车全部在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seized from drug dealers of East coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.84,0:57:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 无名氏先生都说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. Mr nobody said…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.67,0:57:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们想找到多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna have a chance of catching Dom…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.33,0:57:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先必须要够快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to be damn fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.82,0:57:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该能有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.06,0:57:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这辆坦克 有750马力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a tank. 750 horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.79,0:57:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,配6.6升V8通用产发动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}6.6 liter V8 Duramax engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.75,0:57:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶部配备M153远程操作武器台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the M153 probe remotely operated weapon station on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.81,0:57:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是从毒贩那儿弄的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't get this from drug dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.88,0:57:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No that…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.77,0:57:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是向美国军队借的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}United State's army weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.27,0:57:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队研究这种武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the army developing machines like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.74,0:57:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要让士兵在一英里外操控好 保证生命安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the soldiers could drive from a mile way so they can stay safe and alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过好在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But luckily…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.73,0:57:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,里头配备有备用驾驶座{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a back up driver seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.69,0:58:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合我们这种喜欢上手的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for those of us who like to get more hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.88,0:58:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐在里面会觉得这东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting there wondering this whole time when this thing feeling badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.04,0:58:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像芝士工厂配的门童{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's getting fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.75,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不可以对它亲自上手 这不能开到大马路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is getting hands on it. She doesn't go on some streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.84,0:58:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.10,0:58:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个也不行 不行 这是百万美元的样车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again? No. No… That's a million dollar show car.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.35,0:58:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能太招摇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is to not draw attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要搞逆向思维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's reverse psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆绝不会料到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom will never see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.91,0:58:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车是荧光橙色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's neon orange,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.07,0:58:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,连国际空间站都能看得见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The international space station would see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.84,0:58:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能随便选一个不那么扎眼的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go choose anything less inspeculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.37,0:58:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这制动卡盘 太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no. This is ridiculous. Hey my man,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.61,0:58:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 车你放那就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put that down right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.90,0:58:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一件礼物 给我的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a gift. A real gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.43,0:58:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.52,0:58:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的胡子 你就是圣诞老人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your beard. You're blanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.82,0:58:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是黑人版的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.79,0:58:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑 把车放那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm serious. Put it down right here…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.39,0:59:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.79,0:59:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动机打不着火了 我得检查下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine's mis-firing, I gotta check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.90,0:59:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不属于计划内 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's not part of the plan, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.97,0:59:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.87,0:59:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你总不想因为发动机坏了事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unless you want the engine to cease on the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.92,0:59:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你五分钟时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.83,0:59:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再调一下镜头给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want another visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.03,0:59:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个取款机能用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an ATM.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.63,1:00:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.52,1:00:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看到托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.80,1:00:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别的摄像头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no more cameras.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.86,1:00:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就找点别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then find something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.93,1:00:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能反光的东西 哪怕是后视镜都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch in on something reflective A car mirror, anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.67,1:00:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道我是谁吗？- 就为这个来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am? - That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.18,1:00:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我的本事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.09,1:00:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就为这个来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.04,1:00:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝完这杯茶再跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you until I finish my cup up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.61,1:00:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要渴死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm fucking thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.32,1:01:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有自己的节奏 不会浪费你时间的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got limited time. So won't take up too much of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.06,1:01:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.27,1:01:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有价值的东西早被你榨取光了 托雷托先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've already taken everything I have of value, Mr. Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.01,1:01:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想怎样呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more could you possibly want?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.82,1:01:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回报你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give you something back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.28,1:01:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说话啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.77,1:01:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有点不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.68,1:01:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次见我儿子时… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I saw my son…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.06,1:01:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在防弹玻璃后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was behind a bulletproof glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.20,1:01:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他向我伸出手 我却无法抱着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he reached me, I couldn't hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.95,1:01:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最心痛的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the worst pain I ever felt…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.73,1:01:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你完全能体会其中的滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know exactly how that feels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.94,1:01:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许能改变这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could change that…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.43,1:01:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先警告你 我认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I warn you, I think…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提出一个非常危险的建议 托雷托先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are about to suggest something really dodgy Mr Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.79,1:02:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就为这个来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.26,1:02:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 给我再凑近点来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just punch in on something, I'm not liking this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.81,1:02:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样 就觉得不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗兹 快有了吧？- 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rhodes, you close? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 推上去 - 那送货车要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go - The delivery truck's moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.18,1:02:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五大道那边目前有安排执勤 问题不大
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.18,1:02:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续安排巡逻 排查险情
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.37,1:02:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴克·肖 上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Deckard Shaw,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.14,1:02:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以不顾生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}distinguished himself by acts of gallantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.84,1:02:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,远超职责要求的英勇行为脱颖而出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the risk of his life above and beyond the call of duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.41,1:02:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的勇敢行动 拯救了人质和战友的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bold actions saved the lives of hostages and his team mates.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.75,1:03:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议授予 维多利亚十字勋章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recommendation: Victoria Cross.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.25,1:03:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是英国政府授予的最高荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highest honor the British Government has ever given.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.52,1:03:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.79,1:03:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整件事在我看来有些说不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some about this old thing just doesn't add up to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.05,1:03:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情可是无独有偶吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then don't do the same kind of funny math,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.60,1:03:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,某被授予银星的美国军方探员还盗窃电磁脉冲武器呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says a DSS agent who has a soul to stop a valid stolen EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.84,1:03:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着熟悉吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound familiar huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.91,1:03:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能过来帮个忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.58,1:03:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数三下 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On three? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.90,1:03:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二三 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One two…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.89,1:03:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 要是再活一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you can tell this in another letter…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.07,1:03:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩肯定能干一番事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe we could've caused some serious damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.80,1:03:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我们有可能 - 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, we could have - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.83,1:03:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜等这完事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame I'll have to punch you,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.19,1:03:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你脑壳摔烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}head of defend, when this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.34,1:03:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 恕我直言 上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah well. With all due respect, Captain,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.77,1:03:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切结束了我俩找个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this whole thing is over we're gonna find a location.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.84,1:03:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你牙打到嗓子眼去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna knock your teeth so far down your throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后刷牙就只能从屁眼进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna stick a toothbrush right up in your ass to brush up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.82,1:04:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接上天眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me God's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.12,1:04:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天眼已启动 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God's eye active - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.29,1:04:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找那俄罗斯人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find us some Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.53,1:04:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小眼睛请仔细搜寻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spy with my little lie…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.43,1:04:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位国防部长在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minister of defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.17,1:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们九点钟在莫斯科降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We land back in Moscow by nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.52,1:04:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最新的防务报告 有昨天汇报的所有要点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the latest defense report, All the items in yesterday's meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.16,1:04:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标上传到多姆的导航系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upload this coordinates to Dom's nav.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.29,1:05:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在车队第三辆车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the third car.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.83,1:05:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一辆豪华装甲轿车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a guard class limousine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.44,1:05:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的团队呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my team?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.88,1:05:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的团队呢？- 还没发现任何踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's his team? - There's no sign of 'em yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.88,1:05:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在监控网里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.35,1:05:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能躲在什么地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just bunker down somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.38,1:05:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在逼近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing in on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.62,1:05:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点我可以保证 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I can guarantee you Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.89,1:05:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人料到会有这出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.93,1:05:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要利用和操纵车队方圆两英里内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every with chip with the GEODIE exploits.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.99,1:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,每辆车的芯片漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a two mile radius around that motorcade now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.60,1:05:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一千多辆呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's over a thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.10,1:05:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,全给我黑掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hack 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.67,1:06:01.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.85,1:06:11.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动驾驶启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.85,1:06:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,请殭尸车登场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's zombie time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.32,1:06:21.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标已控制）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.48,1:06:23.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安全限制解除）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.36,1:06:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你 就会系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buckle up if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.79,1:06:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动驾驶激活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}AUTO-DRIVE ACTIVATED.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.48,1:06:57.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（防撞功能已禁用）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.28,1:07:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全传感器已被控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe systems are released.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.74,1:07:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.35,1:07:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.94,1:07:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我瞄准车队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target the motorcade.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.55,1:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 好戏要上演了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.59,1:07:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.00,1:08:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.92,1:08:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.57,1:08:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方护卫车搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police escort down.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.21,1:08:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉领头和跟随的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out the lead and follow cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.31,1:08:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开！快开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive! Drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.24,1:08:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又干掉两辆 - 前面还有一辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two more down - There's still a warranty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.63,1:08:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前面还有一辆 朝发动机开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more cars ahead of us. Shoot their engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.80,1:08:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.54,1:09:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一大群车辆在自动驾驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got an army of cars driving themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.64,1:09:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求支持！特种部队支援！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send backup! Send S.W.A.T!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕你们派童子军也行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if you send the goddamn boy scout…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给点帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just send up some help!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.64,1:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.61,1:09:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点开走 快点开走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.64,1:09:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,车队刚拐到第七大道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The motorcade just turned on 7th.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.58,1:09:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 把动静闹大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Make it rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.44,1:10:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.61,1:10:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已无法移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target immobilized.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.98,1:10:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are up Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.97,1:11:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是怎么回事？- 他要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell is that? - What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.64,1:11:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝他射击！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.32,1:11:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊 快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.77,1:11:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没子弹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.45,1:11:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.85,1:11:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 先生 车是防弹的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry sir. This car is bulletproof.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.50,1:11:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.09,1:11:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手提箱给我 - 把手提箱给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the case - Give him the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.11,1:11:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,里头有核弹发射密码啊 我们决不能给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are nuclear launch codes. We cannot give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.39,1:11:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.70,1:12:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,油箱被锯穿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just cut a hole in our gas tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.65,1:12:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.06,1:12:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在会合点等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet you at the pick-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.83,1:12:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到我的团队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know where my team's at.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.97,1:12:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪？- 就在我眼前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.55,1:13:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们冲你来的 快离开 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is on you. Get out of there, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.99,1:13:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我知道多姆为何而来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I know why Dom's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.99,1:13:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方说他抢了个核密码箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police scanners are saying he's stolen Nuclear Football.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.93,1:13:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 托雷托 给我从车里滚出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Toretto. Get your ass out of the car now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.28,1:13:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想玩是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you wanna play this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.28,1:13:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就玩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.69,1:13:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.28,1:13:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got run.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.79,1:13:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干什么？- 这是陷阱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What're you doing? - It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.28,1:13:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.65,1:14:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我理解追我们那些警察的感受了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know what it feels like be every cop ever chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.51,1:14:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再靠近一点 把他别住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a little close and I ped him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.08,1:14:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你还想把多姆逼停？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you just gonna take Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.23,1:14:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小无名氏看来是彻底疯了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Nobody has clearly lost his little mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.65,1:14:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.67,1:14:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 要团队协作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.46,1:14:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心慢着！- 慢着 慢着 慢着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.23,1:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.84,1:14:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去抄近道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take the short cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.15,1:15:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！别撞着人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Watch these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.92,1:15:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Sexy coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回你别想跑 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.47,1:16:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心开车！不然缆绳会断掉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch drive! Or the line will snap!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.52,1:16:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他出来 控制住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretch him out. Hold them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.95,1:17:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那破车估计得用2000马力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gotta have about 2000 Horse Power in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.65,1:17:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试3000马力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try 3000…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.76,1:17:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试5000吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.25,1:17:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧离开那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.61,1:17:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想办法呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.67,1:17:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别琢磨了 动手就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop working on it, and do it…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.88,1:17:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这可是我的宾利啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no no… It's my Bentley.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.63,1:18:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.63,1:18:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着手提箱 赶紧走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that case and run!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.21,1:18:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.05,1:18:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们还以为这就是街头火拚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought… this was gonna be a streetfight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.31,1:18:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还等什么 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait for it…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.06,1:19:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.67,1:19:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.71,1:19:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.19,1:19:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你为什么要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you're doing this,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.47,1:19:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我清楚一件事 你是爱我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know one thing. You love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.27,1:19:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你不会对我开枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not gonna to shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.62,1:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该把箱子给他 省的我来追你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've given him the case, cause I won't chase you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.23,1:20:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.00,1:20:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能从死人手里抢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will just take it from a dead girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把自己搭进去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You willing to die for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.95,1:20:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.89,1:20:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.59,1:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.50,1:21:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部刚确认 那就是核密码箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And D.O.D confirmed it was a nuclear football.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.20,1:21:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着电磁脉冲武器以及核武器发射密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got an EMP and nuclear launch codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.70,1:21:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.25,1:21:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对有阴谋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're building towards something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.66,1:21:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴克呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deckard?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.44,1:21:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没挺过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.00,1:21:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我很失望 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disappointed in you, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.63,1:21:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动紧要关头 你竟然让莱蒂带着密码箱走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna Letty just walk away with the codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.20,1:21:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿到密码了！- 是罗兹拿回的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've got the codes! - Rhodes got the codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.50,1:21:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你选择了放她走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made the choice to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.61,1:21:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我也要做出选择了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I have to make one on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.62,1:22:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这些个小家伙多能招人疼啊 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are adorable little things, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.32,1:22:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我真不希望伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.60,1:22:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着神经病 我可是全按你说的办的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Cipher, I did exactly what you asked me to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.47,1:22:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.88,1:22:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的报应 - 是我的报应吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is your doing - My doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.60,1:22:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸爸 爸爸 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pa pa pa Pa pa Pa pa.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.28,1:22:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要伤害他 我求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt him. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.40,1:22:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你来求我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to beg.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.22,1:22:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要你从中吸取教训 - 吸取什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want you to learn - Learn what?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.35,1:22:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你为什么会那么做 我真的很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand why you did what you did. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.83,1:22:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的选择是错的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was the wrong choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.70,1:22:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这就是你所带来的后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a consequence, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.34,1:23:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.07,1:23:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多姆 先救你儿子 - 不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dom, save your son first - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.80,1:23:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能调取巷子里那男的监控吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you pull up the footage from the guy in the ally.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.20,1:23:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找交通监控 - 明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Traffic cams - I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.78,1:23:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道是他 这个男的我认识他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I recognize that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.35,1:23:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫康纳·罗兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Connor Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.11,1:23:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和肖的弟兄合作时见过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him when I was working with Shaw's brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.02,1:23:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们帮他偷龙葵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted us to get the Nightshade device him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.75,1:23:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳·罗兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.65,1:24:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和一个我很讨厌的人也有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's also linked to somebody who I like to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.56,1:24:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩西·贾康德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose Jakande.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.56,1:24:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个觊觎天眼的小军阀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warlord who tried to get God's eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.59,1:24:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说多姆有两次坏了塞弗的好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that's twice that Dom has messed up Cipher's business.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.91,1:24:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在感受到的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you're feeling right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.78,1:24:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是愤怒还是悲痛 都不是真实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's rage, sense of loss. It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.85,1:24:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证人类种族的延续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a survival instinct wired deep into our brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.44,1:24:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是深深扎根于我们大脑中的一种生态本能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ensure continuation of species.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.65,1:24:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初我们的先人去水边打水时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When early men went visit a watering hole…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.49,1:24:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有个一不留神 孩子被鳄鱼叼走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they didn't watch their child, they got snatched by a crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.76,1:24:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的大脑 会生成充满着悲痛 但又有指令作用的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their brains would create a painful but a structural memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.30,1:24:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能避免悲剧重演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it will never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.47,1:24:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭这个观念是你思想的核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This idea of family that is so core with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.61,1:25:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也主宰者你的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that rules your world…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.64,1:25:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它只是个生物界的谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a biological lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.58,1:25:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.58,1:25:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.65,1:25:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你毁掉我两支队伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really could think you could destroy two of my teams.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.04,1:25:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不用承担后果吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without any repercussions?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.59,1:25:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是因为这些破事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have even looked your way…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.91,1:25:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来看都不会看你一眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn't done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.46,1:25:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不知道自己有个儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even know you had a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.60,1:25:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该感谢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank me for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.06,1:25:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我要求你做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And start doing the job I'm asking you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.47,1:25:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮你挑起战争吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help you start a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.70,1:25:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我要这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.51,1:25:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,思路太局限了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so limited.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.54,1:25:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿密码箱不是要开战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take that football to start a war…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.68,1:25:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣下你儿子也不是要成家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anymore than I took your son to start a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.45,1:25:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣你儿子能帮我拿到密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking your son got me the codes…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.55,1:25:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码让我掌控核弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codes will get me the nukes,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.53,1:25:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹让我掌控我所要的… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the nukes will get me what I want…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.05,1:25:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如今天 比如明天 比如今后的每一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, tomorrow… and every day after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.89,1:25:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.29,1:26:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,至高无上的权限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accountability.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.23,1:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我引爆一两个核弹头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second I fire off\None of those nukes…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.60,1:26:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些个世界上的超级大国就都会明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put the superpowers of this world on notice that…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.60,1:26:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们一越过底线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… when they cross the line,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.01,1:26:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会出马 拿他们一一问罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'm gonna be there to hold the responsible…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.44,1:26:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 这终极真相就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the truth is, Dom…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.61,1:26:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个世界而言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… To the world out there…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.45,1:26:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是水面下那潜伏的鳄鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'm the crocodile at the watering hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.16,1:26:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该干这最后一票了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got one last job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.33,1:26:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.60,1:26:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我要是你 就会亲我儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I would kiss my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.64,1:26:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为无论你在乎与否 所有这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because whether you value it or not, all of this…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.51,1:27:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的飞机 你的安保力量还有你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plane, your security and you…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.72,1:27:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能存在 全因为有他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… are still on this earth because of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.19,1:27:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前无法追踪到塞弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem we have with tracking Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.79,1:27:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为没有任何头绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is there's nothing to trace then.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.13,1:27:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们有了罗兹的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have Rhodes' information.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.87,1:27:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们抢在他数据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're getting snapshots of this data.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被清除前保存了截图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it's scrubbed off the net.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看着像是个银行账户 为什么我们不直接黑进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like somebody's bank accounts? Always just…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示的是经度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Longitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.00,1:27:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于多姆袭击的是俄罗斯车队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given the fact that Dom hit the Russian Motorcade.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.20,1:27:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差不多就在俄罗斯 调出地图来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}safe to say it's Russia. Go ahead, bring up the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.81,1:27:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们来一个个过一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, let's start here run the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.64,1:27:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅尔塔 波尔塔瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yalta, Poltava.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.25,1:27:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就是一大堆陌生名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they just threw letters together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.15,1:27:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科诺恩约特 - 是弗拉多夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Konyert - It's Vladupi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.46,1:27:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.28,1:27:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 我说过会时不时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I was gonna check in on you from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.39,1:27:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看你们进展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see you how you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.48,1:27:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且看起来 不怎么顺啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, not so hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.35,1:27:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但弗拉多夫寸草不生啊 就是个冰雪王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's nothing in Vladiven. It's just ice…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.02,1:27:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That funny…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.53,1:27:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证那有个俄罗斯秘密海军基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've sworn there was a secret Russian naval base.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.54,1:27:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放置冷战时期潜水艇的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the retrophilic cold war Submarines.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.66,1:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 严格意义上说 这基地已不属于俄方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, it's not Russian anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.48,1:28:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在一个月前被一伙搞分裂的恐怖份子占领了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base was take by a terror grope of military separatists.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.12,1:28:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄方到现在还没夺回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a month ago. And the Russians haven't taken it back yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.57,1:28:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们行动有了个小窗口期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there is a little window of opportunity here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.14,1:28:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是俄罗斯潜水艇 又是核密码箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian submarines, nuclear football,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.60,1:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉我们不管怎么做都会被炸上天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it sounds like everything we do our legs gonna be bombed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.11,1:28:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉你还是名单上的第十一名呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you're still a No. 11 on the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.98,1:28:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还感觉你嘴边长了毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like you've changed since you look punk ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.21,1:28:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该办事变得牢靠点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facial hairs and camen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.00,1:28:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys… guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.84,1:28:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得向上汇报 双方一级级请示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta call this in all the way up the chain.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.72,1:28:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想法没错啊 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good thinking champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.66,1:28:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了… 可是俄罗斯的防长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except… unfortunately the Russian Minister of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.66,1:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国期间遭遇了一点小意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got himself involved in little incident on US territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.69,1:28:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方磋商还需要一阵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two governments aren't talking to each other for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.63,1:28:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们谈好我们也来不及了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time they do… It will be too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.47,1:28:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们还有别的建议吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, any other suggestions?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.67,1:28:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个提议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.67,1:28:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们自己动手吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we just stop them ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.70,1:28:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的可是俄罗斯的军事基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about a Russian Military Base.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.80,1:28:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,分裂分子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separatists.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.74,1:28:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁的不都是送死吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.21,1:28:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要避免第三次世界大战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopping world war 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.41,1:28:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那后果吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be rook?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.11,1:28:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回你要闭着眼等死吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna close your eyes on this one too?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.21,1:28:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷世界末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray that the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.87,1:28:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会降临到自家门前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't come knocking on your mama's front door?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.08,1:28:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你还不如扛起枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you're gonna saddle up,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.26,1:29:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,站出来和我们一起拯救这乱七八糟的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}be a man and save the entire goddamn world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.09,1:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知吗 我觉得我想明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.83,1:29:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白什么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.13,1:29:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那第三条规矩 - 是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rule number three - Which is?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.40,1:29:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下压根就没规矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.90,1:29:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I told you, Luke?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.77,1:29:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他会想通的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he'd get in three.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.40,1:29:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输机一小时后起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Areal transport leaves in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.87,1:29:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要什么车随便挑 没任何限制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take whatever vehicle you want. All bets are off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.54,1:29:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没限制了 - 没任何限制？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All bets are off - Bets are off?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.32,1:29:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们再会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.51,1:29:35.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄罗斯 弗拉多夫）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.71,1:29:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂我本来不想告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty I don't like telling you this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.82,1:29:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划现在有变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game's changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.75,1:30:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我们只是想抓住多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we were trying just to catch Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.72,1:30:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但发生了这么多事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now after all of this…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.05,1:30:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是迫不得已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know, if I have to…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.22,1:30:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要干掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put him down…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得连我一块儿杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you might have to take us both down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.59,1:30:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿太差劲了 这里不适合我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freezing man. This ain't for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.29,1:30:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活方式跟这儿差别太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from a different kind of lifestyle brah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.70,1:30:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们了解我 他们知道我什么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies know me. They know where I'm at with.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.43,1:30:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我刚去解个手 都快认不出我自己了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to take a piss, I ain't even recognize myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.87,1:30:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你这信息量也太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's entirely too much information.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.23,1:30:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.70,1:30:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 有件事可以确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one thing is for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.11,1:30:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆他们不是互相配合 就是事先有交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom's gotta be either working with them or making a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.56,1:30:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会蠢到不带军队来这种鬼地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause no one will be this insane to hit this place without a damn army.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.01,1:30:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我可说不准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.61,1:30:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一说他他就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.62,1:31:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 多姆 你和大家庭团聚只有一步之遥了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Dom, you're one step closer to that family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.21,1:31:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离基地400米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}400 meters to base.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.55,1:31:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备电磁脉冲炮 干掉对方防御网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep the EMP. Let's take these defenses down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.74,1:31:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有潜在威胁靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a possible threat incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.59,1:31:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即升起路障 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise the barricade, As soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.97,1:31:28.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（EMP 备妥）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.73,1:31:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,停电了 快进入防御{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost power, get to your positions now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.74,1:31:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,门打开了 好戏正式开演了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gates are open. Let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:00.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（EMP 充电）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.15,1:32:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电磁脉冲在充电 - 要多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- EMP's are charging - How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.15,1:32:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要六十秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.25,1:32:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 多姆 你只剩一次脉冲可用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Dom, You've one pulse left in that EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.49,1:32:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那潜水艇基本是绝缘体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sub is heavily insulated.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.22,1:32:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到它正下方才有效果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to be right underneath it, for this thing to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.23,1:32:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.26,1:32:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标锁定 他在潜艇下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging target. He's beneath the Sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.85,1:32:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼救 呼救 失去动力 我要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm loosing control, mayday, mayday. I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.98,1:32:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 这下子一箭双鵰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.80,1:32:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已控制了潜艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got control of the sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.13,1:33:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 我们进展顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, we are good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.00,1:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去会合吧 好的麦迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head over to the Rendezvous. Ok Matty…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.14,1:33:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那小东西转起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… Let's take this baby for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.89,1:33:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.94,1:33:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗刚重启了潜水艇指挥系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Cipher just rebooted that Sub's command system.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.12,1:33:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.78,1:33:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,用外行话说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Leyman's terms…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.34,1:33:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这是要劫走那艘潜艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just carjacked a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.81,1:33:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让它跑掉 那里是控制室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let it get away. There's the control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.05,1:33:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能把我带进那个仓库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can get me into that warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.82,1:33:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能入侵网络反向攻击塞弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tap with network and counter hack Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.05,1:33:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止潜水艇下沉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it from flowing into water.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.45,1:33:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在只需要把我送上潜水艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what we need to do is get me on that sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.95,1:33:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找武器室拔掉发射芯片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find the weapon's room and I can pull the lunch chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.88,1:33:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止她发射核弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she can fire any of those nukes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.42,1:33:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这主意太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is too crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.96,1:33:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的主意又太危险 - 我们双管齐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just saying it's too dangerous - We'll do both.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.84,1:34:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 开门！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock, knock!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.74,1:34:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,五辆车刚刚到达了基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five vehicles just reached the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.08,1:34:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还真是锲而不舍啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just don't give up, do they…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.88,1:34:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 快点啊 各位 都快点 都快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A'right. Let's haul ass team. Double time, double time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.22,1:34:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.98,1:34:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.71,1:35:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.97,1:35:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你一个新坐标 你立即给我赶过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you the co-ordinates, head there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.51,1:35:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不干了 我要我儿子 - 你干不干得我说的算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm done. I want my son - I'll tell you when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.55,1:35:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的团队全来了 你必须和罗兹会合听我的指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your team is in play, now meet Rhodes and follow my instruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.62,1:35:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我掩护你 上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you covered, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.06,1:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 出去！快离开这 快 快 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move! Get out of here, go go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.73,1:35:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你是不是喜欢这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, how do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.70,1:35:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 远程连接被切断了 - 这个我来处理吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remote link has been separated - I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.53,1:36:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.67,1:36:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她夺回控制了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's regaining control.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.23,1:36:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 她太厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, she's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.76,1:36:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进武器室了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are entering the Weapon's room.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.42,1:36:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.60,1:37:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拉啊 拉啊！罗曼 罗曼 赶快找到芯片 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, pull pull! Roman, guard up by the chip, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.17,1:37:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真狡猾 那我还得再放点大招{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh she's slick. Gonna have to do better in that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.29,1:37:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你真要惹毛我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, now you're starting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.53,1:37:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 我们还需要多长时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, how much time we talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.99,1:37:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真聪明 但修行还是不够啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart, but no smart enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.62,1:37:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我封锁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's locked me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.39,1:37:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 我阻止不了她 你一定要拔掉芯片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez, I can't stop. Now you're gonna have to pull that chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.16,1:37:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不行 这东西启动了攻击模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. This thing's going into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.12,1:37:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,芯片拔出来才能打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door's not gonna open until you pull the chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.50,1:37:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 应该拔那个 我们也不知道啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez we got no idea what the hell we are looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.67,1:37:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.80,1:38:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚才到底干了什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.60,1:38:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 不是我干的好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.24,1:38:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有标签 写着发射指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be labeled "Guidance Go"
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.02,1:38:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「发射指令」 - 好的 我好像有发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Guidance Go" - OK. I got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.07,1:38:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 上面写着 哈克弗拉 弗拉瓦赫… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It says haha… slack slack back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.16,1:38:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯摩 得赫瓦赫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… smoke, dear jack na jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.21,1:38:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道啥意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.26,1:38:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真难看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.53,1:38:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是台好戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a show.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.17,1:39:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射核弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming the nuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.71,1:39:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹准备中 她正在开始发射了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuke's going hot, she's trying to fire this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.09,1:39:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 我们马上出去 - 赶快令核弹失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roger that, we're moving out - Disable the nukes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.40,1:39:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 看到什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, what are you seeing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.14,1:39:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 告诉我 - 狗屁都没看到 我还在看呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Talk to me - I don't see shit. I'm holding on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.11,1:39:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have a countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.50,1:39:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事 伙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on man?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.35,1:39:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹马上要发射了 就是这么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are about to launch a nuclear missile, what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.28,1:39:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔掉那该死的芯片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the damn chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.72,1:39:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时 倒计时 快找到倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countdown. Countdown. Look for a countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.25,1:39:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么倒计时？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What countdown?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.26,1:39:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹需要激活才能发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missile needs to activate for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.29,1:39:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒定时器肯定不是写俄文的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown timer won't be in Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.54,1:39:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.43,1:39:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这个世界一点颜色瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's show the world what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.23,1:39:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不要按哪制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. Don't press that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.53,1:39:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.30,1:39:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,出问题 发射不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is wrong. It won't launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.63,1:39:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让潜水艇赶紧下水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that sub out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.90,1:39:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.64,1:40:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your ass Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.47,1:40:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.34,1:40:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都不听使唤了 快跑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing alright about any of this. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.43,1:40:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那核弹怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the missiles?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.61,1:40:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了芯片 她发射不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the chip, no nukes for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.95,1:40:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.98,1:40:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 有追兵 一大批追兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys we got company. A lot of company.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.72,1:40:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好 计划是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright team, here is the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.92,1:40:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海湾入口处有一个闸口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a Sea lock at the opening of the bay,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.20,1:40:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要能提前到达并关上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get there first, and close it,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.40,1:40:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能阻止潜艇进入开阔海域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can stop the submarine from escaping into open water.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.17,1:40:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然它就溜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And disappearing forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.31,1:40:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置已经确认 西南方向十英里处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the location. It's 10 miles south west.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.53,1:40:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,十英里？十秒钟我们到不了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 miles? Like I make it in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.42,1:40:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 这下不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no no, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.77,1:41:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 罗曼 没装雪地胎吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter Roman, you forgot the snow tyre?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.24,1:41:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰博基尼开的爽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loving that Lambo now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.11,1:41:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 各位 待会再处理芯片的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright everyone, hold you with that launch trip later.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.62,1:41:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要潜艇下潜到深海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I want that sub in deep water,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.59,1:41:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开所有探测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where no one can find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.18,1:41:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我最快离开海湾的路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me the fastest route out of that bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.10,1:41:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.69,1:41:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们干嘛都打我啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they shooting at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.38,1:41:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你开桔黄色的兰博基尼啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think off you're in that orange Lamborghini I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.38,1:41:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴 特尔佳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up Tez.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.52,1:41:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.43,1:41:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想发动那辆车吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really wanna put that car in gear?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.52,1:41:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.38,1:41:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.87,1:41:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在赶往海闸那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading for the sea lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.97,1:41:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图把我们潜艇困在海湾里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to trap the sub in the bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.43,1:41:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很早之前就该做个了结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have taken care of this a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.48,1:42:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兹 干掉他的团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodes, took his team out.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.75,1:42:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.71,1:42:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 到我前面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, get in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.98,1:42:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们来硬的是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, y'all wanna play it rough?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.65,1:42:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该轮到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.07,1:42:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 宝贝儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.98,1:42:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们右侧有雪地摩托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we got snow mobile on the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.05,1:42:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要从两面夹击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to flank us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.02,1:42:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们没机会！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No they ain't!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.93,1:43:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.41,1:43:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.67,1:43:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 坚持住 我马上就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman hold tight. I'm on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.68,1:43:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想下去游泳 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go swimming. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.92,1:43:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧？特尔佳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really Tez?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.89,1:43:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不不不… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, No. No. No No…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.46,1:43:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.05,1:43:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 抓紧车门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, grab your door.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.39,1:43:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.49,1:43:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住车门 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the door Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.02,1:43:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下完了 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gone. Oh Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.84,1:44:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么回事呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.69,1:44:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.16,1:44:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.99,1:44:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让我下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me off this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.73,1:44:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tez.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.23,1:44:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.78,1:44:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这烂摊子我真是受够了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, I've had enough of this shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.31,1:44:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我是第十一名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 11 my Ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.53,1:45:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕 我们还要拦截潜艇呢 上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shrink it. We got a sub to catch, get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.09,1:45:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.90,1:45:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,货舱发出了降压警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pressure is on alert in the cargo hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.81,1:45:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,降到一万英尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it to 10 thousand feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.15,1:45:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这些人对你来说有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how much these people mean to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.59,1:45:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我让你选第一个目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll let you pick the first target.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.90,1:45:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会隔着一英里挑目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not picking target from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.42,1:45:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和他们面对面站着 看着对方眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stand face to face, and look 'em dead in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.90,1:45:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.50,1:45:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就挑你老婆吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.83,1:45:38.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等待连接）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.82,1:45:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机不错啊 我愿意接手它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice plane. I'm gonna enjoy her remains.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.42,1:45:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别瞎打主意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't go get any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.05,1:46:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃飞机的亏还少吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and planes don't have a good history.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.13,1:46:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.12,1:46:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 小子 这些混蛋可不会自己来送死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go scarface. The arseholes ain't gonna kill themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.37,1:46:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就调出监控画面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up surveillance, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.34,1:46:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.38,1:46:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是已经死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pierce must be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.40,1:46:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车 我一开始就说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're driving. I said it from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.84,1:46:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 我不开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way, I'm not driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.50,1:46:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,货舱部位出现入侵的情况 立即给我处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a security breach in the cargo hold. Take care of it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.47,1:46:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 老妈 你应避开神经来打啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Mum, you should pose to avoid the nerves.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.32,1:46:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧 别这么孩子气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up, don't be such a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.68,1:47:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找飞行员 他有第二把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the pilot, he's got the second key.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.49,1:47:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等我信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.66,1:47:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向塞弗问好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Cipher my regards.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.41,1:47:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,托雷托他履行承诺了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Torretto hold up his end of the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.40,1:47:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我们留下了这个小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave us this little thing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.22,1:47:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别碰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.44,1:47:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用这个追踪到塞弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can track Cipher with this,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.92,1:47:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能一个人去 必须得两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't do this on your own. There's gotta be two of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.25,1:47:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这儿有熟人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I got contacts.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.41,1:47:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你带你弟弟去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gonna take your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.01,1:47:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别啊 - 听话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.25,1:47:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,托雷托知道他在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torretto knows where he is…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.22,1:47:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用这东西就能看到一切 好像叫恶魔的屁眼之类？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got this thing. He can see everything it's like it's called the devil's bumhole or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.36,1:47:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它叫天眼 - 好吧 随便吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's called the God's eyes - Yeah, well. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.89,1:47:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能带上欧文 好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way I'm using Owen, alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.53,1:47:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无药可救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.67,1:47:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是你兄弟 戴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother, Deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.43,1:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是我儿子呢 是我们的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my son. He's our family.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.44,1:48:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our family that died…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.06,1:48:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可以死在监狱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody shit happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.14,1:48:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说欧文 老娘真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied about, I mean, I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.35,1:48:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真气死我了 你真让妈好难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotten upset, you really upset your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.48,1:48:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还配当哥哥吗你 你这个… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call yourself a brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.95,1:48:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 妈妈 好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm in, mum. Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.49,1:48:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都这样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.49,1:48:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧文 - 就位了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Owen - In position.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.68,1:48:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.86,1:48:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.53,1:48:41.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等待连接）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.52,1:48:49.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来电 私人号码）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.52,1:48:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,包裹已经到手了 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the package to lay on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.68,1:48:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无损啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole pounds of him…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.88,1:48:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 爸 爸 爸 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pa pa pa pa pa.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.30,1:49:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄得我打偏了目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me miss my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.34,1:49:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.61,1:49:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着你至死为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at you dead in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.13,1:49:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是为了埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.94,1:49:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗兹 - 他永不能陪着我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rhodes - He is no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.38,1:49:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兹选错了目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodes picked the wrong target.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.68,1:49:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你啊 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.16,1:50:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚害死你亲儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just killed your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.35,1:50:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.68,1:50:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚被我救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.19,1:50:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你刚好放虎归山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just took your foot off the tiger's neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.63,1:50:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 待会可能有点吵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome. It's gonna get noisy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.67,1:50:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for your relief.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.64,1:50:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好听吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.41,1:50:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.65,1:50:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 给我拦住他 不许让他下飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go stop him, do not let him get off this plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.65,1:50:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有个大麻烦 那卡车的导弹够干掉我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck's got enough munition to take us all out.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.32,1:50:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别被它瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't give 'em a target.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.50,1:50:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都开到前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get in front of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.66,1:50:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,排成一列准备攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}line up, we will take the hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.02,1:50:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我现在就要换车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I need to switch cars, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.97,1:51:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准锁定
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.01,1:51:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗曼 现在要受点苦头了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roman, here comes the bad part - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.75,1:51:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家坚持住！我们就快到海闸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there guys! We're almost through the lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.29,1:51:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得轻巧 又不是你屁股着了火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy for you to say, when your ass ain't on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.54,1:51:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright little mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.26,1:51:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面可能有点吓人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's might be a little scary,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.42,1:51:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也会很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.31,1:51:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐好听吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the music good?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.32,1:51:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们锁定目标了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're locking on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.39,1:52:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉各位 我也没招了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry guys, I got no trick for us…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.35,1:52:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办啊？- 大家都祈祷吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do now? - We start praying.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.32,1:52:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太牛了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.16,1:52:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是多姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.27,1:52:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又跟我们一伙儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy in our side now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.72,1:52:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢 反正他刚才救了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell cares, He just saved our asses.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.47,1:52:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴 又能和你一起飚车了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to be riding with you again man.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.69,1:53:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,托雷托为他们开了路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torretto just cleared the way for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.35,1:53:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来给我点回应啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone give me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.90,1:53:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鱼雷准备完毕 - 那就发射啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Torpedoes are ready - Then launch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.52,1:53:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.34,1:53:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来把方向盘 - 我就不做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take the wheel - I ain't taking shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.93,1:53:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来把方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.02,1:53:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.58,1:53:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是疯了！- 加速啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is crazy! - Speed up,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.02,1:53:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往左打死！- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Left and back! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.06,1:53:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把方向盘向左快速打死不就完事了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the goddamn wheel to the left, really quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.33,1:53:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 宝贝儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.27,1:54:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走一个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's alright!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.18,1:54:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.06,1:54:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来笑一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that smile?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.62,1:54:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.70,1:54:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然朝婴儿开枪 你混蛋到家了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna shoot a baby You shoud bust it…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.04,1:54:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你还是别看了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't gonna wanna see this?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.65,1:54:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这味儿是你的还是他的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you or him?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.89,1:54:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.73,1:55:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼雷没击中目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The torpedo's missed,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.09,1:55:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在我们之前抵达海闸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are gonna reach lock before the sub does.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.08,1:55:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.07,1:55:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看好戏吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.72,1:55:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.02,1:55:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得换辆大点的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to need a bigger truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.61,1:55:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们正下方 快离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are right down of us, get out the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.48,1:55:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快离开这儿 - 你怎么就知道大喊大叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get us out of here - Why are you always yelling?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.15,1:56:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那贱人疯了吗？- 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This bitch is crazy! - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.76,1:56:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不太妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.60,1:56:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.16,1:56:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我 我们不需要太担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me there's nothing we need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.17,1:56:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.12,1:56:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是我的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.86,1:56:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水艇距离太近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sub's too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.00,1:56:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来不及赶到闸口了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't making it to the gate in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.83,1:56:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么让它走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gonna let it get away?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.26,1:56:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多姆在 就不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if I know Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.77,1:56:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输定了 多姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loose. Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.27,1:56:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我灭了你两支队伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I destroyed two of your teams.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.81,1:56:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还杀了你的红头发男友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed your red headed boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.97,1:57:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把两枚炸弹放到你那可躲避追踪的飞机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I put two killers on your untraceable plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.44,1:57:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打扰我度蜜月那一刻起就已经输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost the minute you interrupted my honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.82,1:57:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在猜猜我为谁而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now guess whom I'm coming for.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.18,1:57:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,热追踪导弹瞄准他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a heat-seeker on him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.75,1:57:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.91,1:57:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.33,1:57:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是个热追踪导弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a goddamn heat seeker coming at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.44,1:57:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头跑 往海边跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peel off, head to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.53,1:57:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 赶紧来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my… come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.93,1:58:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no… No!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.47,1:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位！快下潜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Dive…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.67,1:58:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是替我儿子报仇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… This is for my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.66,1:58:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.22,1:59:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没子弹了 戴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are out of bullets Deckard.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.75,1:59:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收拾你根本不需要用枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm need a gun to take care of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.82,1:59:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.16,1:59:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看看以前的多姆吗 看好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see the old Dom? Watch!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.23,1:59:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是机智啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.27,1:59:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为很多事情负责啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a lot to answer Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.17,1:59:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们家受了多大罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pulled my family through.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.59,1:59:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,气的我妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.47,2:00:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确保历史在任何人身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make sure that never happens again.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.71,2:00:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不再重演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To anyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.78,2:00:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的计划只有一个漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one flaw in your plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.32,2:00:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么漏洞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.58,2:00:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩就我拿着降落伞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of us has a parachute!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.74,2:00:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 会很好玩儿的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you this would be fun!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.18,2:00:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该降落了 伙计们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to land, Boys!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.05,2:00:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我永远不会丢下你的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've never left you, Letty?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.62,2:00:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.32,2:00:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我以后也不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know I never will…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.92,2:00:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.90,2:01:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好多话想跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've so much to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.77,2:01:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是吗 你可以从那个贱人开始说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah you do, and you can start with that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.15,2:01:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是他 多姆尼克·托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's… Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.45,2:01:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆！我不想打断你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Dom! I'm just towing it out there?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.26,2:01:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得离开这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get up out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.89,2:01:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为冰下都是核武器之类的玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause this all kinda neuclearism happening under this ice.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.19,2:01:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 没有触发芯片这些核弹没有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax! Without the trigger chips, those nukes are harmless.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.83,2:01:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok. So we good then.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.87,2:01:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要来点高难度的自拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lemme go and get my young selfie levels up.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.40,2:01:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是涉密的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize this is classified, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.44,2:01:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.53,2:01:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.82,2:01:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 赶紧将身躯带离这里 我快冻死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, can we give our body out of here now. I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.44,2:02:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没事啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.34,2:02:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他很快就会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, he's gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.84,2:02:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他们有很多共同爱好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, y'all got a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.78,2:02:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算机黑客 天眼系统 技术狂 书呆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer hacks, god's eyes, geeks, nerd.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.26,2:02:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我俩也有很多共同点 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, but we got a lot in common too! Alright?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.02,2:02:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如说呢？- 我俩不论走到哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like what? - We walk in the room,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.05,2:02:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能瞬间吸引异性的目光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are oozing sex appeal.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.18,2:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩光站在一起就要出问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and you? There's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.47,2:02:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要问个严肃的问题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am asking the real question right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.96,2:02:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两部电影给你选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.33,2:02:45.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,是《菜鸟大反攻》呢 还是《黑暗骑士》呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Revenge of Nerds?" or "The Dark Knight?"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.60,2:02:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 你俩我都喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest I like both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.76,2:02:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就对了 - 我怎样给你说 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A'rigt! Yeah…yea! - What I told you! Babay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.89,2:02:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我们聊这个之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just before we get into all of that,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.78,2:02:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你们一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you one question.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.18,2:02:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想问我什么都行 - 什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can ask me anything - Anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.92,2:03:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我姓什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my last name?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.65,2:03:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们搞清楚了 然后再向我汇报吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you guys figured it out, then I guess you can let me know.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.83,2:03:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正以后姓帕克 这个才是重要的 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a Parker. That's all that really matters.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.01,2:03:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是琼斯吗 叫帕克夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones, Miss Parker.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.27,2:03:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Miss Parker.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.82,2:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘻 - 莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey - Letty.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.13,2:03:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.33,2:03:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.82,2:03:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗还在逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher's still on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.27,2:03:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有线报称她在雅典{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been some reports she's in Athens.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.67,2:03:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她近期是不会对任何城市发动核袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she won't be nuking any city anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.37,2:03:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们大家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.54,2:03:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对了 我给你们带了份礼物来 - 肯定不是好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, I got you a parting favor - This can't be good…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.12,2:03:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记录抹掉了 官复原职 你又可以上岗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your record's been cleared. Full re-instatement. You got you job back.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.59,2:03:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 得你本人愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.20,2:03:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我愿意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I want?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.17,2:03:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都干了16年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know after 16 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.14,2:03:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该歇一阵子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it's time for a little break.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.11,2:03:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.25,2:04:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当全职爸爸咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's stayin' home.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.12,2:04:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无名氏 - 保持联系！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody - Get in touch!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.52,2:04:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.52,2:04:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有意思了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.33,2:04:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我会配合？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you think I would do it?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.14,2:04:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为手足情 看到你对塞弗的表情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother-hood. I saw that look you gave Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.47,2:04:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道你想报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you wanted revenge.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.47,2:04:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴 我猜对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.15,2:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到 你敢去找我妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe you went to see my Mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.16,2:04:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你闹的大动静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this fuss of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.00,2:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.21,2:05:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 我保证我儿子会平安的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, I promise to keep our son safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.75,2:05:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会永远平安下去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now… he always will be.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.16,2:05:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在想把你介绍给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to introduce you to the most.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.45,2:05:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全宇宙最重要的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}important person in my universe.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.66,2:05:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从来没有放弃过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will never give up on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.91,2:05:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长得多美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's beatiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.33,2:05:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经说过 人永远不可以背叛家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard me say."That you never turn your back on family"
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.08,2:05:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我想感谢大家 从来没有放弃过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna thank you all for never turning your back on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.75,2:05:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识一下大家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna meet them.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.25,2:05:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.42,2:05:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,介绍一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.11,2:05:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·托雷托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.54,2:06:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.24,2:06:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入家庭 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your family, Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.04,2:06:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 该轮到我做餐前祈祷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I guess he's my turning to say christ.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.25,2:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感谢您赐予我们家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for giving us family.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.36,2:06:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐在这儿祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sit here, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.22,2:06:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您给予我们力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for giving us the strength.
